      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Prior Auth – Pending Status Poller (Phase 6)\nRe-checks every **pending** prior authorization every 6 hours until the payer decides, then updates Supabase and emails the right person.\n\n**Needs:** the Phase 6 SQL run in Supabase, a *Supabase API* credential on the two 🗄️ nodes, and the main workflow writing `pending` rows.\n\n**Safe by design:** mock requests are never sent to Availity. Live status calls only happen for requests the main workflow submitted in live mode.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "56943c38-c46c-47d2-a0e3-3f7488d2bf45",
